OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for sharing extremist
OL,4,Aterror videos
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been jailed for sharing
OL,7,Fracist, neo-Nazi and antisemitic
OL,8,Fmaterial including a video of a
OL,9,Fcomputer game about the Christchurch
OL,10,Fterror attack.
OL,12,FZayan Lorgat, 20, pleaded guilty to
OL,13,Ffour counts of disseminating a
OL,14,Fterrorist publication under the
OL,15,FTerrorism Act 2006 at Leicester Crown
OL,16,FCourt in July.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
