OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for sharing extremist
OL,4,Aterror videos
OL,5,
OL,6,FFollowing a raid on his home in
OL,7,FGrantham Road, Leicester, in October
OL,8,F2024, investigators seized digital
OL,9,Fdevices and found Lorgat had been
OL,10,Fsharing videos and images in Telegram
OL,11,Fchats from the age of 17.
OL,13,FAt the same court on Wednesday, Lorgat
OL,14,Fwas jailed for two years and three
OL,15,Fmonths, given a 12-month extended
OL,16,Flicence period on his release, and his
OL,17,Fdevices were ordered not to be
OL,18,Freturned.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
